# Generic bundled example: Lennard-Jones argon melt (no research content)
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 3.0 87287
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor 0.3 bin
fix 1 all nve
thermo 500
dump d all xyz 200 lj_melt.xyz
dump_modify d element Ar
run 2000
